{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11113080","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11113080","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1111308001:1":{"text":"リース兄ちゃん！肝心なところを教えてくれよ！いったいどうやってサンドクローを倒したんだ？","source_cn":"诡草大哥，你说重点嘛！仔细说说你是怎么打败流沙之爪的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5AB0DEAF2F40415","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1111308002:1":{"text":"俺様がバードマウントのプロってのは知ってるだろ？だから奴らの飼育を手伝いながら、こっそりバードマウント軍団を育て上げたのさ。","source_cn":"你们也知道，我可是驯养陆行鸟的专家！我一面给他们养鸟，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD06EC1D60EAF9A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1111308003:1":{"text":"バードマウント軍団！？すっげー！","source_cn":"哇！陆行鸟军团！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6BAA7ABB887A70F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1111308004:0":{"text":"そうとも！そして軍団のリーダーは俺様の愛鳥、<style=\"highlight\">熾翼のアサルター</style>さ！","source_cn":"没错，我的爱鸟<style=highlight>炽翼冲...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5B68EE4B3ECA3FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1111308005:0":{"text":"それで、それで！？","source_cn":"然后呢然后呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDFF00D2F7B8BED81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1111308006:1":{"text":"それで……赤い月が闇夜に昇る頃……俺様はバードマウント軍団を率いてフランクの本営に突っ込んだ！","source_cn":"然后啊……在那红月高升的夜晚……我率领陆行鸟军团冲进了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD1067EA54A21C65A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1111308007:1":{"text":"バーン！俺様は撃った！一発、二発、三発、四発、五発、六発！全部で六発だ！","source_cn":"嘭！我开了一枪、两枪、三枪、四枪、五枪、六枪！总共六发子弹！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE59174E761CFBC6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1111308008:0":{"text":"そして、その場にいた者は全員倒れた……俺様とバードマウント軍団以外はな！","source_cn":"这时候，整个大本营内，只剩下我和陆行鸟军团还站着不倒！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED916D49745B91A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1111308009:0":{"text":"うわぁ……すごいなぁ。","source_cn":"哇……听上去好厉害。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA2269650009E0A0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1111308010:0":{"text":"それは嘘だ。","source_cn":"他撒谎。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E13884672993938","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1111308011:0":{"text":"え？嘘なの！？","source_cn":"咦！是骗人的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0597296F7484A76A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1111308012:0":{"text":"あんたほら吹きの能力だけはいっぱしだな。","source_cn":"喂，那个叫诡草的。你的肺不错啊，很擅长吹牛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E9F817920753EEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1111308013:0":{"text":"誰がほら吹きだ――って、なっ、なんでお前たちがここに！？","source_cn":"谁说我吹牛——怎、怎么是你们几个？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2FF9224799AD2B44","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1111308014:1":{"text":"オレもここであんたに会うとは思わなかったぜ。サンドクローの鳥飼い野郎。","source_cn":"我也没想到会和你再见，流沙之爪的养鸟人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE1930F81A7E8BBCF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1111308015:1":{"text":"だ、誰が鳥飼いだ！その呼び方はやめろっ！\nバードマウントは言うなれば砂漠の疾風！普通の鳥と一緒にすんな！","source_cn":"什么养鸟人啊！不准用那种称呼叫我！\\n陆行鸟可不是普通...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E34D542B5B175EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1111308016:1":{"text":"あ、いや……今大事なのはそれじゃねぇ！\nなんでお前たちがここにいる！？さっさと失せやがれ！","source_cn":"不对……重点不是这个！\\n你们怎么会在这？快给我滚蛋！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84902F9104D554C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1111308017:0":{"text":"リース兄ちゃん、こいつら誰なの？","source_cn":"诡草大哥，他们是什么人呀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C739B0E141B3A80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1111308018:1":{"text":"あ、そっ、その……こ、こいつらはな、運良くサンドクローから逃げ出した捕虜さ！","source_cn":"这个……那个……他、他们是侥幸从流沙之爪手底下逃出来的俘虏！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E3D769A60FD7219","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1111308019:1":{"text":"俺様がいなかったら、とっくにハゲタカに食われてただろうよ！","source_cn":"要是没有我，估计早被老鹰吃掉了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42E09BBB23CCEEE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1111308020:0":{"text":"まだ嘘をつくのか？","source_cn":"你再编？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B83381853196F2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1111308021:0":{"text":"ぜ、全部終わったことだろ？……お互いやっとあそこから出てこれたんだし、過去はもう忘れようぜ！","source_cn":"都、都过去了……大家好不容易离开那个地方，这些破事就别...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C1BB306A0E22F72","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_femal